        "liquid_U7PKbq": {
          "type": "liquid",
          "settings": {
            "code": "<h3>TEACHERS: GET 6 CONTINUING EDUCATION CREDITS\n</h3><p>Yoga Alliance requires all yoga teachers to accumulate at least 30 hours of continuing education every three years. They recently changed their continuing education requirements to allow 20 hours of online yoga studies to count towards this requirement.</p>\n<p>\nRestorative Yoga Training will fulfill 6 of these online study hours. Get Cyndi's new course and you will receive a certificate of completion after you take a brief completion quiz. This is a great way to expand your teaching and develop your practice while completing your Yoga Alliance CE requirement.</p>",
            "width": "66%",
